cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project or its analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "Survey Data Analysis — Stack Overflow 2024"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Malik Awais"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikb0/IBM-data-analyst-capstone"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible data-analysis pipeline over the Stack Overflow 2024 Developer
  Survey: a documented ETL step (CSV to a normalised SQLite database), a report
  generator (charts plus a written analysis), and a deterministic test suite.
  Includes the owner's completed IBM/Coursera course lab notebooks, which are
  attributed and excluded from the MIT license.
keywords:
  - data-analysis
  - etl
  - sqlite
  - stack-overflow-survey
  - python
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: "Stack Overflow Developer Survey 2024"
    authors:
      - name: "Stack Overflow"
    url: "https://survey.stackoverflow.co/2024/"
    license: ODbL
